        "text": "#### **[16] Apple Maps renames Lake Ontario to \"Lake America\" for US users**\n* **Publisher:** Reuters / Al Jazeera / MacRumors\n* **What is confirmed:** On September 1–2, 2026, Apple Maps updated its geographic labels so that users in the United States see \"Lake America\" when viewing or searching for Lake Ontario"
