      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4425,
        "endIndex": 4635,
        "text": "The change follows an executive order by President Donald Trump updating the US Geographic Names Information System and direct outreach to Apple, mirroring a similar change implemented by Google Maps days prior"
